omarchy-session-restore
=======================

This project is a fork of "Workspace Restorer" by Davedes83:
https://github.com/Davedes83/workspace-restorer

The original project is licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).
The snapshot/restore engine, the browser tab-capture helper
(scripts/capture_tabs.py), and the pure helpers in restoreLogic.mjs
originate from that project.

Changes in this fork:
- Renamed the plugin to "Session Restore"
  (id: io.github.dreed47.session-restore).
- Adds automatic session restore after a reboot / login, driven by an
  Omarchy post-boot hook, with a designated "boot profile".
- Profile storage moved to ~/.config/omarchy/session-restore/.
